{
  "version": "2.22",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "vmv0X",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "01 · References",
      "width": 4400,
      "height": 2680,
      "fill": "#F4F5F7",
      "layout": "none",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pcWiC",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 64,
          "name": "Board Title",
          "fill": "#121418",
          "content": "Focus Guardian — references",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 56,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": -1.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gCKGw",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 150,
          "name": "Brief",
          "fill": "#4A4F58",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1500,
          "content": "Question: what should a calm, premium, non-generic screen-time app look like in light and dark? Direction: Opal × Linear, monochrome ink accent, status colours only for meaning. Sources: Mobbin (real shipped apps), Dribbble (concepts), Opal (closest competitor), icon collections (Solar, Tabler, Untitled UI).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "browser",
          "id": "cEAsp",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 340,
          "name": "Opal — product site",
          "width": 1000,
          "height": 1400,
          "url": "opalapp.com"
        },
        {
          "type": "browser",
          "id": "mJqA1",
          "x": 1160,
          "y": 340,
          "name": "Dribbble — screen time app",
          "width": 1000,
          "height": 1400,
          "url": "dribbble.com/search/screen-time-app"
        },
        {
          "type": "browser",
          "id": "Wx4E5",
          "x": 2240,
          "y": 340,
          "name": "Mobbin — Opal iOS screens",
          "width": 1000,
          "height": 1400,
          "url": "mobbin.com/?redirect_to=%2Fsearch%2Fapps%2Fios%3Fcontent_type%3Dapps%26q%3Dopal"
        },
        {
          "type": "browser",
          "id": "bdhVw",
          "x": 3320,
          "y": 340,
          "name": "Solar icon set (480 Design)",
          "width": 1000,
          "height": 1400,
          "url": "icones.js.org/collection/solar"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "pDZHK",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 1780,
          "name": "Opal — what to take",
          "width": 1000,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#DCDFE5",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "padding": 28,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ikYnZ",
              "name": "Finding Title",
              "fill": "#121418",
              "content": "Opal — what to take",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "U9wrsK",
              "name": "Source URL",
              "fill": "#6C717A",
              "content": "https://www.opal.so/",
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZMX9o",
              "name": "Finding Body",
              "fill": "#2A2E36",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• One big number per screen (\"1h 23m saved daily\") set huge, tabular, with a soft grey gradient.\n• Monochrome ground; colour appears only as a single light source or a reward (gems).\n• Pill CTAs, white on black — matches our ink pill in light.\n• Small eyebrow chips (\"Focus Timer ®\") label sections instead of heavy headers.\n• Avoid: 3D rocks/gems art — that is Opal's identity, not ours.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "HnCgw",
          "x": 1160,
          "y": 1780,
          "name": "Dribbble — patterns & traps",
          "width": 1000,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#DCDFE5",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "padding": 28,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qLYSh",
              "name": "Finding Title",
              "fill": "#121418",
              "content": "Dribbble — patterns & traps",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Vbqse",
              "name": "Source URL",
              "fill": "#6C717A",
              "content": "https://dribbble.com/search/screen-time-app",
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XuFLJ",
              "name": "Finding Body",
              "fill": "#2A2E36",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Strong: Illiyin Studio \"Schedule your focus\" — dark, one score (9.3), thin line chart, black pill CTA.\n• Strong: Ronas IT \"Focus\" — warm coral accent used once, giant time number.\n• Trap: most shots use pastel purple gradients, donut charts and emoji — reads as template/AI.\n• Take: hero number + 1 status chip + one primary action above the fold.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "uazMD",
          "x": 2240,
          "y": 1780,
          "name": "Mobbin — real shipped apps",
          "width": 1000,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#DCDFE5",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "padding": 28,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "RSnNJ",
              "name": "Finding Title",
              "fill": "#121418",
              "content": "Mobbin — real shipped apps",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lPMT8",
              "name": "Source URL",
              "fill": "#6C717A",
              "content": "https://mobbin.com",
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KCb1h",
              "name": "Finding Body",
              "fill": "#2A2E36",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Needs sign-in to browse app screens (Opal, One Sec, ScreenZen, Brick, Freedom). Browser node shares your session: log in here and I can pull real Opal/One Sec flows onto the board.\n• Shipped apps differ from Dribbble: dense lists, grouped settings, clear empty/permission states — use these as the baseline for Ruxsatlar and onboarding.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "eJK0r",
          "x": 3320,
          "y": 1780,
          "name": "Icons — decision",
          "width": 1000,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#DCDFE5",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "padding": 28,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ycKWy",
              "name": "Finding Title",
              "fill": "#121418",
              "content": "Icons — decision",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "E6iQp",
              "name": "Source URL",
              "fill": "#6C717A",
              "content": "https://icones.js.org/collection/solar",
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GytJi",
              "name": "Finding Body",
              "fill": "#2A2E36",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Solar (480 Design), CC BY 4.0, 7.4k icons, variants Linear / Bold / Duotone / Broken / Outline.\n• Plan: Linear 1.5px for resting state, Bold for selected tab & achieved states — a two-state system Phosphor never gave us.\n• Imported as real vector components from Iconify (not redrawn), one reusable component per icon, recolourable.\n• Credit line: \"Icons: Solar by 480 Design (CC BY 4.0)\" on About screen.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "L6kqV",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 2420,
          "name": "Direction",
          "width": 4240,
          "fill": "#121418",
          "cornerRadius": 20,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 14,
          "padding": 36,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "N7H2T",
              "name": "Direction Title",
              "fill": "#F3F4F6",
              "content": "Direction for v2: one number, one state, one action",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zJYFT",
              "name": "Direction Body",
              "fill": "#B6B8BE",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Home leads with a Limit card (big tabular number + state chip: within / near / over limit — over limit gets its own amber surface, never just amber text). Setup-incomplete is a distinct inverted ink banner so it can't blend with the limit card. Light theme ground #ECEEF2 with white panels and hairline borders; dark stays graphite. Accent is ink (light) / white (dark); colour only carries meaning: green done, amber limit, pink blocked, blue info. Icons: Solar Linear + Bold. Type: Inter Display for numbers, Inter for UI.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
